{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1067537-anyone-played-a-thrice-great","id":1067537,"title":"Anyone played a Thrice Great?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-03-24T06:28:18-07:00","id":1067537,"title":"Anyone played a Thrice Great?","content":"I am looking at putting together a new Obrimos PC who has an interest in Hermetic ideas and will eventually join this Legacy. If anyone is aware of a homebrew 2nd edition rewrite I would love to see it, and if anyone's got any experience of playing or STing members of this legacy I would like to hear your feedback.<br /> <br /> In particular I am unsure how Thrice Great get in touch with the particular types of spirit they are interested in. Most Spirit mages make alliances with the local ShadowDwellers, but I am unsure how the Thrice Great go about finding and meeting Henads (the planetary spirits).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6230-katana1515","name":"Katana1515","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T06:51:18-07:00","id":1067547,"title":"","content":"Planetary spirits can be found in places or things that align with particular planets. For instance, just making associations up at random but, if hemlock is associated with Mars then it's possible to find a Mars spirit hanging out around hemlock plant/spirits in the Shadow. Or perhaps Stone Henge is probably a decent place to find moon or sun spirits, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T07:17:03-07:00","id":1067558,"title":"","content":"If you read the 1e legacy write up they actually give a bunch of correspondences between the planets and stuff on Earth that you could use to summon spirits of other planets.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T07:25:30-07:00","id":1067564,"title":"","content":"Hmmm so since theirs an association between the element of water and the Moon you might be able to conjure Moon related Spirits by simply going to your local river? Interesting. For some reason I envisioned these spirits living in more obscure places in the Shadow, though that might just be the repeated use of the word Courts in the book, makes me think of a specific place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6230-katana1515","name":"Katana1515","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T07:31:08-07:00","id":1067568,"title":"","content":"Courts are associations of spirits more than they are actual locations when it comes to spirits.<br /> <br /> I imagine planetary spirits are pretty rare though and you need to know where to look. If I were playing a Thrice-Great I'd keep a record of names and places they reside in or can be summoned with/from. Most Thrice-Great probably get a start on that from their Mentors or by going to the legacy's Temenotic realm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2632,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","user":"Mrmdubois","date":". 03-24-2017, 10:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2632-mrmdubois","name":"Mrmdubois","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6827"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T07:56:29-07:00","id":1067587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mrmdubois</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1067537-anyone-played-a-thrice-great?p=1067547#post1067547\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or perhaps Stone Henge is probably a decent place to find moon or sun spirits, etc.</div> </div> </div> </div>At the very least, I hear demons dwell there and that there is a thriving banshee community.<br /> <br /> More seriously, Planetary Courts are probably the Places-That-Aren't type locales in the Shadow; not corresponding to any real place. Pathways to those realms probably exist in certain places at certain times when their resonance is strongest. The Court of Mars might be reached on a battlefield when Mars is overhead; Jupiter, through the entrance to a famed lawhouse when Jove looms above. Stonehenge, as mentioned, probably has pathways to Helios and Luna.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2855-axelgear","name":"Axelgear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2855_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1450"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-24T10:02:52-07:00","id":1067658,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Axelgear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1067537-anyone-played-a-thrice-great?p=1067587#post1067587\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> At the very least, I hear demons dwell there and that there is a thriving banshee community.<br /> <br /> More seriously, Planetary Courts are probably the Places-That-Aren't type locales in the Shadow; not corresponding to any real place. Pathways to those realms probably exist in certain places at certain times when their resonance is strongest. The Court of Mars might be reached on a battlefield when Mars is overhead; Jupiter, through the entrance to a famed lawhouse when Jove looms above. Stonehenge, as mentioned, probably has pathways to Helios and Luna.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I really like this notion, I could definitely see Legacy members making records of these realms and paths while trailblazing new ones in order to find new spirits. If I get around to actually drafting a 2nd edition rewrite of the legacys attainments I might see if I can work in something about this. Perhaps a twist on Exorcists Eye that also highlights places of suitable resonance? Paired with a Prime based optional upgrade that lets you track such places down from a distance like Sacred Geometry?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6230-katana1515","name":"Katana1515","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6230_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"280"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}